CoupCat is a free, open-source desktop video editor. It is a derivative work:
its editing engine (the crates under src/crates/concat-*) comes from CapCraft
for Android (https://github.com/artcraft-android/capcraft-android), which is
itself built on Concat (https://github.com/jub0t/concat).

  - The reused engine crates (src/crates/concat-*) are copyright Jareer Abdullah
    and the Concat contributors.
